warning[L0014]: an `x` or `z` in a `case` arm matches nothing
  --> case_xz.v:11:13
   |
11 |             4'b1x0z: y = 1'b1;
   |             ^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: `case` compares bit for bit; use `casez` for wildcards
   = note: lint: case-x-z, disable with `// reticle-lint: off case-x-z` or `(* lint_off = "case-x-z" *)`

warning[L0014]: `x` in a `casez` arm matches nothing
  --> case_xz.v:16:13
   |
16 |             4'b1?x?: y = 1'b1;
   |             ^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: `casez` treats `?` and `z` as wildcards, not `x`
   = note: lint: case-x-z, disable with `// reticle-lint: off case-x-z` or `(* lint_off = "case-x-z" *)`

